    "font" : "TeXGyreTermesX-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Finally, we let the disease detection time (\uD835\uDF0F\uD835\uDC51\uD835\uDC52\uD835\uDC61) to be reached at the time at least a single infectious individual is detected with at least 95% confidence, P\uD835\uDC51\uD835\uDC52\uD835\uDC61 = 0.95. The detection time determines the disease prevalence threshold (\uD835\uDC43∗) at which health emergency declarations are issued. Note that \uD835\uDC43∗ is not arbitrarily selected; instead it depends on the preselected surveillance effort."
